  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……というわけで、あのARROW・Bのスミスが、\nライブの関係者席にHigh×Jokerを招待したいと。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しかも、楽屋で一緒に動画を撮ろうという\nお誘い付きで、みんな狂喜乱舞していましたよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そりゃ、あのARROW・Bから連絡が来たら\n誰だってテンション上がるよなあ……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "スミスのおかげで、315プロの公式チャンネルも\n再生数が伸びてるし……すごい影響力だな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自分は前回に引き続き、どこでも簡単に出来る\n筋トレ動画を上げてみたんだが……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "前回以上の反響がありましたね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "筋トレ好きや健康志向の人とかが、\n誠司さんの動画に注目しているみたいです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "やっぱ、好きなことを発信するって方針は\n良かったんだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ってわけで、俺は今度、うちの犬との動画を\n上げようと思ってるんだ。龍は？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺は、得意の裁縫動画で行く予定です！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "source_text": "（得意の……？）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
