        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "とっておき？何それ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
        "step_index": 33,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 33
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大事な日にしかはかない\nヒミツのお気に入りっす！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-35:text",
        "step_id": 35,
        "step_index": 34,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 34
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "当日の心配もいいですが、\n浮かれすぎは注意です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-36:text",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日の練習は、\n全体的にミスが多かったので。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-37:text",
        "step_id": 37,
        "step_index": 36,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 36
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ゴメンーー……\n完全に俺、浮かれてる",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-38:text",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大丈夫。そわそわしてるのは、\nみんな一緒。\nたぶん、ジュンも。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-39:text",
        "step_id": 39,
        "step_index": 38,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 38
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ジュン、最近、ARROW・Bの\n曲ばっかり、聞いてる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_h:step-40:text",
        "step_id": 40,
        "step_index": 39,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 39
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あれは、ただのライブの予習！\nともかくみんな、\n気を引き締めるように！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
